        "id": "intro-comment",
        "type": "nodetool.workflows.base_node.Comment",
        "data": {
          "comment": "# Inspect a Clip\n\nReads a clip's header to report its duration. Use it as a cheap check before an expensive generation step, so you know what you have before paying to transform it.\n\n**How it works:** \"Clip\" passes the video to \"Read the header\", which reads its properties without decoding the frames. \"Duration\" shows the length in seconds. It is local processing with no model or key.\n\n**Try this:** Connect another output of \"Read the header\", such as width, height or frame rate, to a new Output node to see more of the clip's properties."
        },
